@startuml nvmServiceStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Initialized

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Initialized : Init()

Initialized --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

Initialized --> Initialized : Save(pBlob)
Initialized --> Initialized : Load(key, pData, maxLength)
Initialized --> Initialized : Erase(key)
Initialized --> Initialized : EraseAll()
Initialized --> Initialized : Exists(key)
Initialized --> Initialized : ComputeCrc(pData, length)

note right of Initialized
    Non-Volatile Memory Service
    All operations require initialization
    Multiple concurrent operations supported
    CRC validation on load operations
end note
@enduml
